Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?EGO:=20ESP=20=E5=90=AF=E5=8A=A8=E9=A1=B9?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=A0=87=E9=A2=98=E6=94=B9=E4=B8=BA=20ColorOS=2017.0.1=20(alph?=
 =?UTF-8?q?a-v1)=EF=BC=88=E5=90=AB=E5=8D=95=E6=B5=8B=E4=B8=8E=20check=5Fin?=
 =?UTF-8?q?stall.py=EF=BC=89?=
